{"id":"vod_bf_150850","vodId":"150850","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"LV999的村民","name_cn":"LV999的村民","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260701-1/f8b469ae8eb95a0b14a67bfd1e5609a7.webp"},"summary":"剑与魔法的世界——艾斯克里亚。在这个世界里，人们生来就背负着等级与既定使命。战士、格斗家、僧侣、魔法师、盗贼、商人、猎人、咒术师、国王、贤者、勇者。而其中数量最多、毫无力量、最弱小的角色……“村民”。 某日，一对村民父子遭遇魔物袭击。当那位青年飒爽登场，轻松击倒怪物时，那对父子惊得目瞪口呆。“镜浩二、村民……等级……999！？”达到 LV999 的极致境界，反抗既定命运的村民——镜浩二。魔族之巅的魔王之女——爱丽丝。两人相遇后，与伙伴们共同追寻魔族与人类共存的理想。在这个被命运赋予“对立”的世界里等待着他们的，将是这个世界不为人知的法则……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-10 00:16:30","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/LV999decunmin/b63d489b1885/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/LV999decunmin/eace8fb770ae/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/LV999decunmin/665b2041cfca/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/LV999decunmin/dd64600507e1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/LV999decunmin/a778b50359fe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/LV999decunmin/d30e7e6e90f3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/LV999decunmin/b55d5801f7ff/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/LV999decunmin/679857173180/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/LV999decunmin/01aebca8f967/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/LV999decunmin/266cf5eee017/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/LV999decunmin/4badcf2761f4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/LV999decunmin/f1930186cb35/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:16.172Z"}